            {
               "text": "### Prerequisites\n\nThis game practices the measures studied in **Measuring in three dimensions** (<htcite0>). Before playing, read that text: there we measured a string with one ruler, a square and a rectangle with two rulers, and a cube with three rulers.",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "b56ef907-93eb-45ee-ae22-ce4f364ffa4e",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "Measuring in three dimensions",
                     "date_time": {
